FOUNDER-AGREEMENT-TERMSHEET.md

# iCloud sync-conflict copies: "broadcast 2.ts", "CLAUDE 2.md", ".gitattributes 2".
# This clone lives inside iCloud Drive, which duplicates files it thinks are in
# conflict. They are byte-copies (or STALE copies) of tracked sources, so they
# are never work - and they are actively harmful: a stray "launchScene 2.ts"
# beside the real one has already broken Metro and tripped TS1149 on
# case-insensitive macOS. 907 of them accumulated by 2026-09-13.
* [0-9]
* [0-9].*
